{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_02_end",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_02",
  "title": "扩大防守范围",
  "storyCode": "OD-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "757cb428df9381a1b89de8d666201069a58e4500d554ef379c5aecf3d7c951fa",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "停火！小心平民！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "他们跑了，科恩！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "别管了，保护其他人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerToken": "char_458_rfrost_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "portraitKey": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "来人帮帮忙，这边有人受伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "先把他们抬进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "医生！你还好吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在这儿！我没事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的腿！我的腿断了！我的腿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "冷静，你的腿还在，只是脱臼了，咬紧牙关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "妈妈......妈妈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁看到阿尔加的妈妈了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "重伤的镇民",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "救命......救......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "char_empty",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "绷带要不够了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "混账东西，*粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "那边是不是着火了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "那个方向，是镇中心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "看来不只是这里遭到袭击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么，领主卫队去哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "别管什么领主卫队了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "到处都是打斗声，事情变麻烦了，我们不能在这里逗留，这里太空旷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "先把那几个伤员抬到建筑后面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者镇民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_165",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怪物！怪物又来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者女性",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_163",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "救命啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "没完没了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "亚历山大！你去屋顶掩护我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "来不及了医生，我们必须离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是我们能去哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "先去你的诊所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "别管那么多，先让所有人都去你的诊所。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来人搭把手！他走不动了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "库兹，你看看还有没有其他人躲在屋子里，再把这个社区的人都带到诊所去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "注意安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "......真是一场灾难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "四十多个人......所有人都在这里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们救下的人......都在这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "少了多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不少人跑丢了，可能是去了镇子那边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是有一些老人......他们来不及......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "别想了，不是你的错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "这些怪物，它们是从哪儿来的？它们是训练过的战兽吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道......我以前没见过这种东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "那些暴徒掏出武器的时候，这些怪物就从地里钻出来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "别管它们是从哪儿来的，这些东西也太多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "周围的情况怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "一塌糊涂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "镇子那边有打斗声，我不确定发生了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我们还有多少弹药？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerToken": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "portraitKey": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "不多了，我还剩下四个弹匣，如果亚历山大的弹药用完了，我们就麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerToken": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "portraitKey": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "弹药问题还不是最要紧的，这间屋子快撑不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerToken": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "portraitKey": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "凭那怪物的个头，哪怕漏掉一两个，它们都能撞穿这堵墙，我们是守不住的，得想想办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "医生，病人的情况呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不少人受伤了，我只能简单包扎一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "绷带和酒精都不太够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerToken": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "portraitKey": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "有没有办法先离开镇子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "离开镇子之后要去哪？带着这么多人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "没有食物和水，他们跑到荒地上就是寻死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我不觉得这些怪物会放弃袭击我们。到了荒地情况只会更糟，没有掩体，无法藏身，再加上我们都看见了它们的钻地本事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道一个地方......说不定是安全的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "镇南边有一个很特殊的建筑，可能是镇上最安全的地方，和领主的大宅差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "详细说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以前有一个叫罗德岛的医疗组织，在镇子边缘租了一块地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "后来他们雇佣了工人，挖了不少土石，在那里修建了很结实的屋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......说不定是这里最结实的屋子？看着像堡垒一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "你怎么知道“罗德岛”会愿意帮助我们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米亚罗",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_160_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那间屋子只有一个看门人，我认识他，我从他那里买过一些医用补给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "很多土石，多半是挖了地下室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "听起来像是雇佣兵的安全屋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "感觉很不可靠。"
    },
